description	"Boushh

A agile bounty hunter with explosive power who enjoys the kill a little too much.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Thermal Detonator (2)
-- Heals In Hand, 100%+ Damage
-- Applies Drain/Ignite/Flash
- Boushh's Model 44 Blaster (3)
-- 30%+ RoF, Drains On Hit, Mag Reload
-- 20%- Damage/FP Drain, 10%+ Velocity
- Boushh's Staff (Staff Saber)
-- Saber Defense (2), BP Free Jumps, 90 Damage
-- Tracks/Pulses/Staggers On Hit
- High Yield Prox-Mines (3)
-- Flashes/Drains, 100%+ Damage, Sec Fire Only

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Close Combat (3)
- Slow Faller/Grapple Hop/Bunny Hop (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- 40% Faster CDs
- Blast Armor/Melee Resist
- Ubese Environment Protection Suit (Env Protect 3)
- Advanced Filters (Water Breathing)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact JUMP]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Specialty Tracking Darts (16) ^3[CS3]
-- Poisons/Cripples
- Infection Whip (Grapple Hook 2) ^3[CS4 ^3Melee]
-- Applies Blind/Slippery/Poison"
